OL,3,ATwo re-arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Aassisting Iran intelligence after RAF
OL,5,AFairford incident
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo men have been re-arrested after an
OL,8,Fincident near RAF Fairford last month,
OL,9,Fcounter-terrorism police have said.
OL,11,FA 24-year-old UK national, and a
OL,12,F25-year-old dual UK-Iranian national,
OL,13,Fare being held on suspicion of
OL,14,Fassisting a foreign intelligence
OL,15,Fservice under Section 3 of the National
OL,16,FSecurity Act 2023, with police saying
OL,17,Fthe investigation relates to Iran.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
